Create a new enterprise-grade QKMS module for Qguard Helix.

Module name: Qguard Helix QKMS — Quantum-Safe Key Lifecycle Manager

Goal:
Build a Quantum-Safe Key Management System that manages the full lifecycle of cryptographic keys and proves key governance, ownership, rotation, storage, policy compliance, and PQC readiness.

Important rule:
Do not break or modify existing backend logic, authentication, tenant isolation, SSE/WebSocket wiring, scanner logic, migration logic, or existing APIs unless required for integration. Extend the platform cleanly.

Core concept:
QKMS is not just a key vault. It is a Key Lifecycle Control Plane.

Workflow:
Discover Keys → Classify Purpose → Assign Owner → Enforce Policy → Rotate/Expire → Validate PQC Readiness → Generate Audit Evidence

